      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Asthma is a chronic condition in which inflammatory changes occur in the airways characterized by mucosal inflation. While it is a chronic disease, it can be managed quite effectively in most patients. This article presents several of the new treatment guidelines for asthma."},
